# 🎉 TranslatorPro

A clean, professional Python package for translation with support for online (Google) and offline (Transformers) translation, speech recognition, and text-to-speech.

## 🚀 Features
- **Online Translation**: Powered by `deep-translator`.
- **Offline Translation**: Powered by Hugging Face `transformers` (Helsinki-NLP models).
- **Voice Interface**: Speech-to-text and Text-to-speech integration.
- **Modern UI**: Built with `customtkinter`.

## 📁 Project Structure
- `src/translator_pro/api`: Public interfaces and Facades.
- `src/translator_pro/core`: Business logic and interfaces.
- `src/translator_pro/infra`: Infrastructure implementations (translation engines, I/O).
- `src/translator_pro/models`: Data structures.
- `src/translator_pro/ui`: User Interface components.

## 🛠️ Installation
```bash
pip install .
```

## 🧪 Testing
```bash
pytest
```

## 📜 Usage
```bash
translator-pro
```
